1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
The investigators pin the first route across the floor plan and mark the cameras that saw it.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:20,000
A tray of receipts explains why the first ten minutes matter more than the rest of the night.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:30,000
The second corridor narrows toward the exit and forces the team to compare two competing timelines.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:40,000
One still frame shows the guard turning away just before the missing interval begins.

5
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:50,000
The evidence board isolates a silent gap where the package changes hands off camera.

6
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:00,000
A second map redraws the route in reverse to prove the return path was shorter than expected.

7
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:09,000
The team compares timestamps from the loading door and the boutique alarm panel.

8
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:18,000
The final board leaves one narrow interval highlighted as the only remaining unanswered gap.
